sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant T as Tool
    participant N as Graph node
    participant G as Graph
    participant H as FeedbackCallbackHandler
    participant M as FeedbackManager

    Note over H: on_*_start remembers each run's<br/>thread, node, tool call, and run ID
    Note over T: raises TimeoutError
    T->>H: on_tool_error(error)
    H->>M: submit(TOOL, TIMEOUT, tool call) with context
    T-->>N: error propagates
    N->>H: on_chain_error(same error)
    Note over H: already recorded<br/>for this run: skipped
    N-->>G: error propagates
    G->>H: on_chain_error(same error)
    Note over H: skipped, and the run's<br/>state is cleared
    Note over H: GraphInterrupt and other<br/>control flow: never recorded
